# From a person to a mortality conclusion
#
# Socrates is described as a man. One forward N3 rule says that every man
# is mortal, allowing eyeron to derive the mortality statement.

@prefix : <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eyepl/examples/if-then#> .

:socrates a :Man .

{
    ?x a :Man
} => {
    ?x a :Mortal
} .
